llierten Helm-Client verfügen. Falls Sie noch keinen Kubernetes-Cluster eingerichtet haben, lesen Sie bitte die ",[190,206,209],{"href":207,"rel":208},"https:\u002F\u002Fkubernetes.io\u002Fdocs\u002Fsetup\u002F",[194],"Kubernetes-Installationsanleitung",".\nSie können jeden Kubernetes-Cluster verwenden, einschließlich lokaler Cluster wie Minikube oder KinD, oder Cloud-Anbieter wie GKE, EKS oder AKS.",[198,212,214],{"id":213},"_1-helm-chart-repository-hinzufügen","1. Helm-Chart-Repository hinzufügen",[186,216,217],{},"Fügen Sie das FiveNet-Helm-Chart-Repository zu Ihrem Helm-Client hinzu:",[219,220,225],"pre",{"className":221,"code":222,"language":223,"meta":224,"style":224},"language-bash shiki shiki-themes material-theme-lighter material-theme material-theme-palenight","helm repo add fivenet https:\u002F\u002Ffivenet.app\u002Fcharts\nhelm repo update\n","bash","",[226,227,228,250],"code",{"__ignoreMap":224},[229,230,233,237,241,244,247],"span",{"class":231,"line":232},"line",1,[229,234,236],{"class":235},"sBMFI","helm",[229,238,240],{"class":239},"sfazB"," repo",[229,242,243],{"class":239}," add",[229,245,246],{"class":239}," fivenet",[229,248,249],{"class":239}," https:\u002F\u002Ffivenet.app\u002Fcharts\n",[229,251,253,255,257],{"class":231,"line":252},2,[229,254,236],{"class":235},[229,256,240],{"class":239},[229,258,259],{"class":239}," update\n",[198,261,263],{"id":262},"_2-namespace-erstellen","2. Namespace erstellen",[186,265,266],{},"Erstellen Sie einen eigenen Namespace für FiveNet, falls Sie noch keinen haben:",[219,268,270],{"className":221,"code":269,"language":223,"meta":224,"style":224},"kubectl create namespace fivenet\n",[226,271,272],{"__ignoreMap":224},[229,273,274,277,280,283],{"class":231,"line":232},[229,275,276],{"class":235},"kubectl",[229,278,279],{"class":239}," create",[229,281,282],{"class":239}," namespace",[229,284,285],{"class":239}," fivenet\n",[198,287,289,290,293],{"id":288},"_3-aktuelle-valuesyaml-abrufen","3. Aktuelle ",[226,291,292],{},"values.yaml"," abrufen",[186,295,296,297,299],{},"Laden Sie die Standard-",[226,298,292],{},"-Datei für das Helm-Chart herunter, um Ihre Bereitstellung zu konfigurieren:",[219,301,303],{"className":221,"code":302,"language":223,"meta":224,"style":224},"helm show values fivenet\u002Ffivenet > values.yaml\n",[226,304,305],{"__ignoreMap":224},[229,306,307,309,312,315,318,322],{"class":231,"line":232},[229,308,236],{"class":235},[229,310,311],{"class":239}," show",[229,313,314],{"class":239}," values",[229,316,317],{"class":239}," fivenet\u002Ffivenet",[229,319,321],{"class":320},"sMK4o"," >",[229,323,324],{"class":239}," values.yaml\n",[198,326,328,329,331],{"id":327},"_4-valuesyaml-konfigurieren","4. ",[226,330,292],{}," konfigurieren",[186,333,334,335,337,338,341,342,346,347,351,352,355],{},"Bearbeiten Sie die ",[226,336,292],{},"-Datei entsprechend Ihren Bereitstellungsanforderungen. Details zum Abschnitt ",[226,339,340],{},".fivenet.config"," finden Sie auf der ",[190,343,345],{"href":344},"..\u002Fconfiguration\u002Fconfig-reference#must-set-config-options","Konfigurationsreferenzseite",", insbesondere im Abschnitt ",[348,349,350],"strong",{},"\"Must Set Config Options\""," und in der Referenzliste oben, um eine funktionierende ",[226,353,354],{},"config.yaml"," für FiveNet zu erstellen.",[186,357,358],{},"Prüfen Sie mindestens die FiveNet-Konfiguration, Secrets, Persistenz und wie die Bereitstellung in Ihrem Cluster erreichbar sein soll.",[198,360,362],{"id":361},"_5-fivenet-installieren-oder-aktualisieren","5. FiveNet installieren oder aktualisieren",[186,364,365,366,368],{},"Deployen oder aktualisieren Sie FiveNet in Ihrem Kubernetes-Cluster mit der konfigurierten ",[226,367,292],{},"-Datei:",[219,370,372],{"className":221,"code":371,"language":223,"meta":224,"style":224},"helm upgrade --install fivenet fivenet\u002Ffivenet \\\n  --namespace fivenet \\\n  -f values.yaml\n",[226,373,374,392,401],{"__ignoreMap":224},[229,375,376,378,381,384,386,388],{"cla